Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信，每个人都有他的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有独特的“力量”和“才能”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一个地方可以让他尽情发挥所长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:01:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有地方可以让他尽情发挥所长…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（求职面试 超级攻略）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言，那地方就是贵公司
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.32,0:01:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加藤…吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！跌了下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,本班列车不停站，即将驶入2号月台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位乘客退到黄线后方等候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫车长来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快叫人来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔，你怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！能起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问，可以下来帮手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝醉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！起身呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮手！谁都可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是阿计吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车要来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来多两个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:05:02.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《杀戮都市》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是东京铁塔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,打不开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都锁上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽地方？医院？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，刚才在月台…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被电车辗过！你不理我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎会呢？最初…我认不出你来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！你又怎会不理我呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小学之后未见过？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过三次啦！中学时…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有没有被电车辗过？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为何还活着？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然和我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被车撞倒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是什麽地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂！两房一厅版本！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是其中一个假设
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是假设！我肯定自己死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽…？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也是这样出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什麽她全裸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿开它！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的一天，早晨来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人期待的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺起胸膛，迎接欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,昂首阔步，仰望青空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着收音机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎着清风，扩展胸襟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸，一起体操
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！1，2，3！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:42.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你们的生命 已经完结）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:45.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如何使用你们的新生命是我的自由）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:49.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（就是这样）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.16,0:09:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽…？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:57.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（5该你地去收拾这位仁兄）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,5该？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:12.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（葱星人）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:16.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（特征：强臭；喜欢：葱）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,体温很暖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是睡着了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玄野）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,写着我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,山田…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎会这样？ 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻森，这是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玄野）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要玩Cosplay吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要穿上吗？ 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（岸本）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姓岸本？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之比没穿衣服好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,合身吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一早知道我会来？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只不过是玩具吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么重手，不是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但枪口是密封的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！别向着我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪口是密封的，看！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别向着我！ 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起…没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！有什麽事，快说出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起自己被送入医院时…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人打了针
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,打针？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我也是被车撞倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我血流披面，被送入院
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:15:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给我注射了一些药
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后意识开始朦胧…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医院打针，有何出奇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对，真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始明白整件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们果然还未死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是处于假死状态
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被送人医院打了同一支针
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,产生同一种幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像“集体催眠”一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都看着同一幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们在参加同一个古僵实验
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:39.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（5该快行动）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外面？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于可以回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再隐瞒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是电视节目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都在催眠状态中参加这节目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我未死！对吧？我还未死！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸是电视台监制
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,节目由美国电讯和耶鲁大学策划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个真人骚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:18:00.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《全美一叮》的冒险版
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没听过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全美一叮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成任务，你就可获十万美元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爲了这奖金，走后门参加
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,十万美元？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是一千万日圆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤，看看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看清楚，他就是目标人物！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟内，最先消灭他的人可获奖金
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上个月被公司裁走…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是小孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知的话，便亲自去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！你别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生！别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开！散开！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你葱！给你葱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这面具做得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去捉他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近连一个人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？我们好像在兜圈？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:39.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多摩市）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是多摩市
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们搞什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下我们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住在哪里？我送你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,算点呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,围着他！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了哪里…？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去了哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.76,0:22:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑得真快！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,开灯！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你葱！ 可以开枪了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.56,0:23:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你葱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你葱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你葱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好劲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜牲！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.28,0:24:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.64,0:24:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好迫真！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.04,0:24:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.08,0:25:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什麽，大嚿哀！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.56,0:25:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起！放过我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.04,0:26:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！射他吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.12,0:26:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快报警…报警
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.00,0:27:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快回那房间了…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,催眠药快失效了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.24,0:28:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！加…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.20,0:29:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.80,0:29:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎算好？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,空的！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.36,0:30:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,连箱都用埋，都是第一次见
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.12,0:30:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜还是失败
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.36,0:30:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，你终于发现这举身衣的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开枪吧，分数归你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.64,0:31:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快动手！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.76,0:31:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙杀掉了那么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这眼神，我喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太令我失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样，下回合会死
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.56,0:33:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么多生还者，很久没试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.80,0:33:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快解释清楚！这真是电视节目吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.36,0:33:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问“Gantz”吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.28,0:33:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来之前，大家就叫大黑球做Gantz
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.92,0:34:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔，你过了关！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论伤得参多重，只要活着，就能还原
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.84,0:34:34.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在开始计分）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.24,0:34:41.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（岸本O分 胸部太大）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.48,0:34:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.16,0:34:47.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加藤O分 太过震腾腾）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.20,0:34:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.96,0:34:52.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（铃木O分 看不见你的存在）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.52,0:34:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不见我？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.24,0:34:57.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玄野O分 看岸本看得太多）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:34:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.08,0:35:04.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿西5分 总共79分）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.36,0:35:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只得5分？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.84,0:35:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.08,0:35:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟搞什麽鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.40,0:35:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gantz给我们的表演评分
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.16,0:35:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮侵略地球的外星人是我们的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟是什麽人？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.72,0:35:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.72,0:35:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲笑而已！别那么震腾腾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.40,0:35:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩了！其他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,全被杀掉了，你也亲眼看到
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.12,0:36:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是在Gantz行动中死掉的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.24,0:36:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到那黑帮大佬被爆开吗？多痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.24,0:36:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那催眠理论家也被扁
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了也不知发生什麽事！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.48,0:36:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我见过更劲的…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.28,0:36:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何见死不救？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.64,0:36:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一两个…你这种伪君子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.40,0:36:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然一头雾水
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.40,0:37:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骂错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.32,0:37:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开加藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.08,0:37:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开枪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.76,0:37:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今次一定开
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.64,0:37:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快解释清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.00,0:37:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什麽鬼地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.36,0:37:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.52,0:37:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.68,0:38:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,发梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.44,0:38:45.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目击者请联络警方）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.44,0:38:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是昨天我们看到的意外？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.16,0:38:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.12,0:38:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，厕所没厕纸
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.68,0:39:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真脏！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.80,0:39:17.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（乘容被电车辗过…）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.60,0:39:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.12,0:39:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有他的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.48,0:39:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有独特的「力量」和「才能」
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.52,0:39:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一个地方可以让我们尽情发挥所长
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.56,0:39:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我们公司，想做些什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.52,0:39:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,想做什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.12,0:40:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,见工说这些话，一定见不成
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比他好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.52,0:40:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有公司请玄野？ 当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一间都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.92,0:40:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来，他毫不起眼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.64,0:40:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种人，没有公司想请
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.92,0:40:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还当自己是足球明星
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.16,0:40:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是小学时的威水史！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.24,0:41:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种人一出来社会，就会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.72,0:41:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日课堂到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.52,0:41:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的话，别放在心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.20,0:41:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是毫不起眼的人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.68,0:41:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样才能突出自己呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.96,0:41:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上次在车站碰到小学同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.68,0:41:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.88,0:41:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小学之后未见过？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.28,0:41:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.56,0:41:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小岛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.72,0:41:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫小岛多惠
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.28,0:41:58.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小学毕业纪念册）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:07.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大田区矢口2丁目）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.80,0:42:27.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（这六年来谢谢你）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.08,0:42:32.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（永远是好朋友 加藤）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.56,0:42:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计，你果然犀利！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.92,0:42:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤，别忘记我救过你！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.48,0:42:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎会忘记？我们永远是好朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.32,0:42:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿亮，那么早回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.80,0:42:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，是我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.32,0:42:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计？我不知道你回来了，很久没见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.40,0:42:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.12,0:43:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到工作了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.60,0:43:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在找
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.80,0:43:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿亮已考上了大学，你也要争气
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.12,0:43:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋也拆掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.72,0:43:36.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大田区 矢口二丁目）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.12,0:43:46.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多摩市一宫）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.72,0:44:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.36,0:44:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得我？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.64,0:45:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.88,0:45:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.84,0:45:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我起身时穿着这紧身衣
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.56,0:45:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了加藤的家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.80,0:45:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.72,0:45:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟他…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.32,0:45:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认一下前日发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.20,0:45:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.12,0:45:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像已搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.04,0:45:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他十年前的地址
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.60,0:45:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如去报警？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.40,0:45:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎会相信我们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.12,0:45:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.28,0:46:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你去车站吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.40,0:46:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.32,0:46:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有件事想麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.32,0:46:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽事？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.00,0:46:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚可住在你家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.52,0:46:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.16,0:46:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.88,0:46:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡上面，可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.00,0:46:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.28,0:46:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.12,0:46:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡在地上，明天起来会周身骨痛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.20,0:46:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我睡下面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.96,0:46:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你睡我的床吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.52,0:46:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不回家，没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.00,0:47:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我男朋友的东西还在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.48,0:47:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，你们同居？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.36,0:47:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近分手了，他搬去另一个人的家
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.76,0:47:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.40,0:47:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我在浴缸…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.16,0:47:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,割脉了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.16,0:47:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实，我不是真的想…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.16,0:47:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是自杀？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.88,0:48:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来时，我发现自己回到家里…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.20,0:48:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直不敢去浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.72,0:48:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕看到自己尸体浸在血淋淋的浴缸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.96,0:48:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.12,0:48:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤给我的外衣
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.96,0:49:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何，我都要见他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.40,0:49:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还这外衣给他，向他道谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.56,0:49:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的日记？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.04,0:49:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有他的地址
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.32,0:49:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,少年惩教所…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.44,0:49:35.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加藤胜 获假释）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.56,0:49:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾是少年犯？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.68,0:49:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再看了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.32,0:49:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有他的地址
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.88,0:49:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他没考入高校
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.12,0:50:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又有什麽关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.48,0:50:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他家里一直很多问题
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.40,0:50:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爸是酒鬼，喝醉就打人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.92,0:50:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤也可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.44,0:50:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是那种人！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.08,0:50:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么体贴的人，我从未见过
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.20,0:50:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我早点认识他…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.96,0:50:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不用去死？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.24,0:50:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我多口…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.08,0:50:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.12,0:50:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灯了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.80,0:51:37.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加藤胜 杂工）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.52,0:52:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.88,0:52:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.40,0:52:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不睡觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.96,0:52:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会就睡
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.68,0:53:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又睡不着？发噩梦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.84,0:53:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿步，快去睡
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.44,0:53:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别睡过头！没早餐吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.56,0:53:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.28,0:54:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的一天，早晨来了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.04,0:54:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人期待的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.76,0:54:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺起胸膛，迎接欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.52,0:54:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,昂首阔步，仰望青空
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.40,0:54:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着收音机
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.24,0:54:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,人齐了？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.60,0:54:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎着清风，扩展胸襟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.20,0:54:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸，一起体操
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.12,0:54:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！1，2，3！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.48,0:54:53.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你们的生命 已经完结）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.48,0:54:55.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如何使用你们的新生命是我的自由）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.96,0:54:57.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（就是这样）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.36,0:55:06.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（5该你地去收拾这位仁兄）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.92,0:55:18.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（田中星人 特征：为人爽朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.80,0:55:20.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喜欢：卡式收音机）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在明白了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.32,0:55:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gantz已把我们扫瞄，对我们了如指掌
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.20,0:55:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们一定逃不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.52,0:55:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算去到天脚底，每次都会被带回来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.56,0:55:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次…？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.08,0:55:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要不断重复吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.68,0:55:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.16,0:55:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来之前，Gantz已一直召集人类…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.48,0:56:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来打外星人，战死了就由新人补上
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.44,0:56:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.32,0:56:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我生还下来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不一早说出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.96,0:56:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一早说的话，他们或者有救！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.28,0:56:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还未明白？伪君子！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.08,0:56:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用他们做饵
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.96,0:56:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,答中！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.96,0:56:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我是同一种人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.44,0:56:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.32,0:56:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人杀戮人类时，总是犹豫不决
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.16,0:56:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.76,0:56:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说清楚好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.88,0:56:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,想生存下去，应该怎样做？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.28,0:56:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求人不如求己，用吥脑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.24,0:57:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这紧身衣…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.88,0:57:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上吧，应该有用
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.68,0:57:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.52,0:57:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.72,0:57:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.44,0:57:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要重复几多次？几多次？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.64,0:57:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.88,0:57:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之穿上战衣吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.84,0:57:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗箱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.40,0:57:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.72,0:57:33.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（5该快行动）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.16,0:57:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.72,0:57:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.76,0:57:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮太！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.40,0:57:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮太！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.24,0:58:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.16,0:58:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.72,0:58:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮太！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.28,0:58:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮太！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.28,0:58:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.68,0:58:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮太！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.44,0:58:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.72,0:58:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮太！没事了！婆婆在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.92,0:58:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.44,0:58:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.00,0:59:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.92,0:59:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野…？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.48,1:01:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撑不住了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.08,1:01:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧身衣废了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.44,1:01:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.68,1:01:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.24,1:01:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.40,1:02:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哗！很危险！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.64,1:02:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.32,1:02:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.96,1:02:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拿100分
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.52,1:02:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,100分？拿了100分会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.48,1:02:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有100分的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.68,1:03:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以令我复活
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.44,1:03:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.20,1:04:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.08,1:04:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！我开枪了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.48,1:04:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动不了！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.08,1:05:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.08,1:05:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.20,1:05:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,吥？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.24,1:05:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.08,1:05:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.40,1:05:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.24,1:06:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.68,1:07:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.80,1:07:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我先开枪了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.68,1:07:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.52,1:09:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.20,1:09:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.36,1:09:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.88,1:09:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什麽事？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.08,1:09:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.76,1:09:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.08,1:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.88,1:10:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着…？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.96,1:10:26.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在开始计分）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.92,1:10:32.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（岸本O分 盯着加藤太久）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.04,1:10:37.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加藤O分 被岸本看得太久）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种评分，有什麽意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.60,1:10:43.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（铃木O分 他出现过吗？）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.68,1:10:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.36,1:10:47.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白石O分 她出现过）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.08,1:10:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.92,1:10:52.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玄野7分 总分7分）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,7分
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.92,1:10:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.96,1:11:00.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（还差93分便完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.76,1:11:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拿100分！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.96,1:11:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gantz…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.08,1:11:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿了100分，会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.40,1:11:57.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拿了100分 有以下选择）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.96,1:12:05.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（100分餐单）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.68,1:12:09.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1.清除记忆 获得释放）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.20,1:12:11.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2.令死者复活）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.96,1:12:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.52,1:12:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了的人，可以复活？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.52,1:12:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.04,1:12:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是发梦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.20,1:15:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.16,1:15:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！你接电话了！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.60,1:15:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我，小岛呀，同班同学
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.40,1:15:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次打给你！你现在在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.28,1:15:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里…？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.92,1:15:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野，你看过漫画吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.84,1:15:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…当然
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.76,1:15:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢看吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.44,1:15:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般而已
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.44,1:15:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，但别取笑我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.48,1:16:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…我在画漫画
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.52,1:16:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麽类型的？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.44,1:16:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.88,1:16:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.84,1:16:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用少女漫画手法画英雄，很奇怪吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.92,1:16:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拣了像你一样的平凡少年做英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.36,1:16:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像小时候的我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.40,1:16:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.48,1:16:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然想起小时候
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.68,1:16:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常保护一个孱仔，不让他被人欺负
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.52,1:16:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.56,1:16:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.92,1:17:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天，我偶然碰见他
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.44,1:17:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他已忘记我，忘记我保护过他
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.44,1:17:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无错…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.64,1:17:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄是要去收拾坏人的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.88,1:17:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕的人，可以马上走！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.60,1:17:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护大家
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.88,1:17:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:18:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来还外套
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.60,1:18:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见了我弟弟？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.40,1:18:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，但我没跟他说话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.12,1:18:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎样解释我们的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.48,1:18:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.72,1:18:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那房间究竟是什麽一回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.68,1:18:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…是死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.84,1:18:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是活着？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.84,1:18:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那房间醒来时
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.00,1:18:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为自己终于死了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.76,1:18:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都觉得…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.44,1:18:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了也没所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.92,1:19:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在，我很想活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.12,1:19:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我遇到你，加藤
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.88,1:19:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你救了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.64,1:19:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.20,1:19:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.40,1:19:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是少年犯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.64,1:19:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把父亲杀掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.56,1:19:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.04,1:19:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天喝到大醉后，便虐打我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.84,1:19:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想救他…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.28,1:19:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但救不了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.80,1:19:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时候不在阿步身边
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.12,1:20:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我以后都不会剩下阿步一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.28,1:20:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我说了些奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.24,1:20:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.28,1:20:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,5号清晨，品川一个停车场突然起火
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.56,1:20:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀疑是有汽车泄漏燃油引起
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.68,1:20:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细原因仍在调查当中
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.56,1:20:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,同类事故亦于…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.04,1:21:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多摩市、港区等多处发生
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.76,1:21:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方不排除多宗案件是有关连性的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.52,1:21:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来很累，今天不如告假？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.40,1:21:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太辛苦的话，我可以去打工
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.56,1:21:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱说！你专心读书好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.08,1:21:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了不开心的事？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.00,1:21:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.32,1:21:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近，我经常发噩梦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.08,1:21:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦见很多人死
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.00,1:21:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人被杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.84,1:21:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我完全帮不到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.60,1:21:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个也救不了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.40,1:22:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好那只是发梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.72,1:22:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.16,1:22:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我最近也发梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.12,1:22:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦见你突然走了，销声匿迹
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.72,1:22:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不怕
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.16,1:22:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怕的是你，没有我你怎算？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.56,1:22:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会煮饭吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.08,1:22:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿步
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.56,1:22:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥不会走，不会销声匿迹
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.08,1:22:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道！给我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.36,1:22:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.64,1:23:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有他的角色
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.40,1:23:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有独特的「力量」和「才能」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一个地方可以让我们尽情发挥所长
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.04,1:23:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.80,1:23:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿步
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.44,1:23:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.36,1:23:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要开始了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.60,1:23:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.76,1:24:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚，各位
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.64,1:24:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是召集死者之地
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.32,1:24:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能往极乐净土？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.48,1:24:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要往无间地狱？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.36,1:24:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,慈悲我佛，在此决定我们的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.04,1:24:35.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（臭脾气星人）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.04,1:24:37.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（特征：巨大；喜欢：清静的地方）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.28,1:24:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家，我们还未死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.88,1:24:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要齐心一起战斗，活着回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.40,1:24:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把所知道的，都告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.28,1:24:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，穿上这箱子内的紧身衣
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.60,1:24:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前来过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.92,1:24:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战斗，即使你不想打，也要打
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.80,1:24:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.64,1:25:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别被妖孽迷惑！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.08,1:25:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我佛说，他不是人，他是烦恼的象征
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.32,1:25:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我吧！大家就可生存下来！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.40,1:25:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快穿上紧身衣吧！快穿上！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.04,1:25:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.92,1:25:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,初来报到不会明自，别浪费时间！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.12,1:25:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想救他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.40,1:25:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,想，所以我一个人去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.60,1:25:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去送死吗？像那高中生一样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.80,1:25:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟那家伙不同
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.48,1:25:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我也会保护你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.40,1:25:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没所谓，但我不想再有人死！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.52,1:25:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.12,1:25:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真心说这话？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.92,1:25:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是，你自己想快些回去而已？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.40,1:25:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.76,1:25:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看穿了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.36,1:25:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是个伪君子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.44,1:25:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没这样想…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.16,1:26:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个少年犯，别再扮英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.84,1:26:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.96,1:26:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.08,1:26:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.52,1:26:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间吵架了…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.88,1:26:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,妖孽呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.28,1:26:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,仁美呢？她刚才还在我身边
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.64,1:26:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快穿上紧身衣吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.16,1:26:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要相信那人说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.64,1:27:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,犀利…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.48,1:27:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是上野博物馆？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.36,1:27:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很迫真啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.20,1:28:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.48,1:28:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是黑球上的…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:28:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标人物？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.40,1:29:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家，请听清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.60,1:29:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人难以置信的恐怖事情将会发生
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.28,1:29:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要齐心协力，保住性命…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.44,1:29:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枪没用！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.08,1:29:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.80,1:29:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.80,1:29:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.36,1:32:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,围着他！开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.84,1:32:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计，你走开！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.56,1:32:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙我来收拾
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.48,1:32:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜牲！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.68,1:32:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计，快躲开！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.52,1:33:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带大家撒退！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.24,1:33:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人怎撑… 我会收拾他！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.36,1:33:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是送死！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.68,1:33:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,射中了！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.52,1:33:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别阻头阻势！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.28,1:34:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,心服口服吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.68,1:34:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.84,1:34:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,同伴死掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.12,1:35:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.92,1:35:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后你要确保所有人撤走
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.96,1:35:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人由我来收拾
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.72,1:35:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不送我们回房间？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.92,1:35:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.08,1:36:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.36,1:36:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.84,1:36:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一头怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.16,1:38:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野，后面呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.88,1:38:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,千手外星人…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.24,1:39:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂有此理！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.72,1:39:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.12,1:39:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死的！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.60,1:39:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤得很重 我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.84,1:39:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然没变，由小到大都那么勇
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.92,1:39:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就想变成你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.88,1:39:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.32,1:39:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计，你说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.08,1:39:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者，我只是想回去
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.04,1:39:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是伪君子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.92,1:39:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我好好照顾阿计
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.00,1:39:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.08,1:41:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们先出手攻击我们
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.60,1:41:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把我的同伴杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.48,1:41:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.92,1:41:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧！加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.84,1:43:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.04,1:43:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿步在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.64,1:43:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要回去…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.68,1:45:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.00,1:45:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.08,1:45:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.08,1:45:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你们
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.92,1:46:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你们的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.56,1:46:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.64,1:49:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.64,1:49:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.56,1:50:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.76,1:50:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知我一定得
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.24,1:50:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.96,1:51:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.56,1:51:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.52,1:51:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.16,1:51:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤，打完了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.96,1:51:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然是我心目中的英雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.08,1:51:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.80,1:51:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作些！马上可以回那房间了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.08,1:52:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计，多得你…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.24,1:52:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以回去见阿步…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.72,1:52:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.64,1:52:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.00,1:52:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！Gantz！快送走我们！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.40,1:52:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤，不要死呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.72,1:52:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.56,1:53:10.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在开始计分）
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.36,1:53:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.12,1:53:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤还未回来
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.60,1:53:21.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玄野 13分 总共20分）
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.88,1:53:24.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（还差80分便完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.52,1:53:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gantz…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.12,1:53:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看死者册
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.40,1:54:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.68,1:54:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把加藤还给我！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.24,1:54:21.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（100分餐单）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.44,1:54:23.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1.清除记忆 获得释放）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.68,1:54:25.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2.令死者复活）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.88,1:54:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我一直战斗，令他复或？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.56,1:54:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我打到100分？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.76,1:54:47.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加藤）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.72,1:54:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不可能…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.16,1:54:58.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（岸本）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.60,1:55:00.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白石）
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.76,1:56:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.44,1:56:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫昼的下一集，我昼好了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.00,1:56:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，今天没心情
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.24,1:56:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没心情看漫画
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.08,1:56:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…最近…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.12,1:56:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什麽事？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.72,1:56:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次，给你看我的漫画时
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.68,1:56:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.80,1:56:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野你…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.88,1:56:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.44,1:57:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的反应很古怪…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.12,1:57:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我很害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.52,1:57:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常有留意你，所以我马上感觉到
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.32,1:57:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常偷偷看着你…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.60,1:57:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.20,1:57:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这种女孩，你很讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.44,1:57:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！跌了下去！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.80,1:57:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的帽呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.12,1:57:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以！电车快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.96,1:57:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，电车快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.48,1:57:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.08,1:57:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帽子！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.72,1:57:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.48,1:57:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.40,1:58:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.76,1:58:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给你
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.32,1:58:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.00,1:58:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.12,1:58:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.68,1:58:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔好意思！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.52,1:58:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,本班快车不停站，即将驶入2号月台
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.24,1:58:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要超越黄线
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.84,1:58:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.56,1:58:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你傻了？快上来！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.16,1:58:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.16,1:58:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,玄野！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.72,1:58:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以死呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.68,1:59:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.52,1:59:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.96,1:59:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.88,1:59:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.00,1:59:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不可以死！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.04,2:00:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.56,2:00:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿步？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.20,2:00:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.80,2:00:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.16,2:00:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有他的角色
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.28,2:00:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有独特的「力量」和「才能」
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.24,2:00:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一个地方可以让我们尽情发挥所长
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.88,2:00:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，天赋「才能」的人要努力
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.24,2:01:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须把他的「力量」完全发挥
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.56,2:01:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想活着回去
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.16,2:01:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去我女朋友身边
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.04,2:01:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在等你回去…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.04,2:01:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就要和我们一起活着回去！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.16,2:01:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟随你吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.24,2:01:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我相信，我也能做得到
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.76,2:01:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还未死
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.16,2:02:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿100分…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.40,2:02:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让死了的人…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.72,2:02:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,复活重生！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.84,2:02:17.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（100分餐单）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.48,2:02:19.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1.清除记忆 获得释放）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.88,2:02:22.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2.令死者复活）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.88,2:02:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.96,2:02:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起作战吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.64,2:02:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的一天，早晨来了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.44,2:02:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人期待的早晨
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.28,2:02:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺起胸膛，迎接欢乐
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.20,2:02:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,昂首阔步，仰望青空
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.16,2:02:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着收音机
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.12,2:02:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎着清风，扩展胸襟
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.00,2:02:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸，一起体操
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.84,2:03:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！1，2，3！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.36,2:03:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,起行吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.32,2:03:14.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,《杀戮都市》
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.60,2:03:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据Gantz原着漫昼改编
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.08,2:05:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,待续…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.08,2:09:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听过这传闻吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.48,2:09:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个大黑球的神秘房间
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.44,2:09:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通人不能进表
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.12,2:09:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gantz发生了变化…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.68,2:09:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池用完了？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.80,2:09:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他杀死我的！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.28,2:09:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没见
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.48,2:09:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿计
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.32,2:09:59.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终于）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.56,2:10:00.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一切谜团）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.68,2:10:02.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（逐一解开）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.80,2:10:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快传送我过去
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.48,2:10:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gantz！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.44,2:10:10.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最后的星人）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.32,2:10:12.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最后的目标）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.96,2:10:13.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小岛多惠）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.16,2:10:16.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最后的战斗）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.48,2:10:23.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（留给他们…）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.44,2:10:25.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最后的选择）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.96,2:10:31.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《杀戮都市：完美答案》
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.12,2:10:34.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一个终极的选择）
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.80,2:10:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有另一个方法…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.76,2:10:40.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（见证终极完美答案！）
